Suggests:
 greetd,
Description: sleek, minimal Wayland desktop
 tetra is a desktop environment built on a wlroots compositor, with the
 shell and apps drawn with Dear ImGui and one JSON configuration file with
 live reload.
 .
 This package contains:
  * tetra, the compositor (window decorations, snap zones, window memory,
    animations, Xwayland);
  * tetra-shell: the F-key task bar, app launcher with power menu, tray,
    notifications, volume and brightness OSD, lock screen, polkit agent
    and screenshots;
  * tetra-settings, tetra-terminal and tetra-monitor;
  * tetra-portal, an xdg-desktop-portal backend (file chooser, screenshots,
    colour picker, screen sharing, settings);
  * tetra-greeter, a login screen for greetd.
 .
 It brings its own builds of wlroots 0.20 and of the newer wayland, libdrm,
 pixman and libxkbcommon that wlroots needs, in /usr/lib/<triplet>/tetra,
 used by tetra's programs only.
